  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This funding will help create an inclusive society in Egypt where there is no discriminated or deprived societal group. According to research, 14% of the employers who have not hired PWD (Persons with Disability) stated that the lack of qualified candidates is the reason behind not employing them. Proposed activities inlcude Essential Work Skills Workshops incorporating complex problem solving, people management, service orientation, negotiation, creativity, and emotional intelligence trainings.</narrative>
